            </note>
            <note corresp="#d246-f2" n="2" xml:id="d246-f2-content">
                <p>Printed from a copy that indicates Hodges signed the original.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d246-f3" n="3" xml:id="d246-f3-content">
                <p>On an August 6 transmittal memorandum from Wyman to Hodges, attached to the
                    source text, Hodges wrote out the postscript, which in slightly amended form
                    became the typed postscript to this letter.</p>
            </note>
